OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man found dead
OL,4,Ain house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a man in his 30s was found dead
OL,8,Fat a house in Greater Manchester.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FKempster Gardens, Salford, on 12 August
OL,12,Fat 05:20 BST following reports of a
OL,13,Fdisturbance.
OL,15,FGabriel Joao Gurney Sacutti, 37, of
OL,16,FBridge Road, Coalville, Leicestershire,
OL,17,Fhas now been charged with murder and
OL,18,Fremanded in custody, Greater Manchester
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,21,FHe is due to appear at Manchester and
OL,22,FSalford Magistrates' Court later.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
